{
  "text": "FIND CARE\n\nRequest care\n\nTell us who needs help and when. Review your details before sharing with caregivers.\n\nReview request\n↓\nChat with support\n✓\nPerson & help\n— Ready\n✓\nSchedule\n— Ready\n✓\nLocation & notes\n— Ready\n4\nReview & publish\nUse saved information (optional)\n\n01 · PERSON & HELP\n\nWhat kind of care would help?\n✓\nOne visit\nCare on one specific date and time.\n✓\nRecurring care\nA repeating weekly schedule with a familiar caregiver.\n\nWho is receiving care?\n\nMe\nA family member\n\nUse a saved care profile (optional)\n\nChoose the person once and we will share the same caregiver preview with this request.\n\nChange\nEllie\nMother · Reviewed Sep 7, 2026\nFamily member receiving care\nRelationship to you\n\nHelp needed\n\n✓\nCompanionship\n✓\nDaily living assistance\n✓\nErrands\n✓\nLight housekeeping\n✓\nMeal preparation\n✓\nMedication reminders\n✓\nTransportation\n\n02 · SCHEDULE\n\nVisit schedule\nStarting day\nStarting time\nDuration (HH:MM)\n01:00 (1 hour)\n01:30 (1h 30m)\n02:00 (2 hours)\n02:30 (2h 30m)\n03:00 (3 hours)\n03:30 (3h 30m)\n04:00 (4 hours)\n04:30 (4h 30m)\n05:00 (5 hours)\n05:30 (5h 30m)\n06:00 (6 hours)\n06:30 (6h 30m)\n07:00 (7 hours)\n07:30 (7h 30m)\n08:00 (8 hours)\n08:30 (8h 30m)\n09:00 (9 hours)\n09:30 (9h 30m)\n10:00 (10 hours)\n10:30 (10h 30m)\n11:00 (11 hours)\n11:30 (11h 30m)\n12:00 (12 hours)\nSchedule: Sep 14, 2026 at 10:00 AM for 02:00 (2 hours)\n\n03 · LOCATION & NOTES\n\nWhere will care happen?\n\nCaregivers see the area before applying. Exact details stay with the request.\n\nStreet address\nApartment, unit, or gate (optional)\nCity\nState\nAlabama\nArizona\nArkansas\nCalifornia\nColorado\nConnecticut\nDelaware\nFlorida\nGeorgia\nIdaho\nIllinois\nIndiana\nIowa\nKansas\nKentucky\nLouisiana\nMaine\nMaryland\nMassachusetts\nMichigan\nMinnesota\nMississippi\nMissouri\nMontana\nNebraska\nNevada\nNew Hampshire\nNew Jersey\nNew Mexico\nNew York\nNorth Carolina\nNorth Dakota\nOhio\nOklahoma\nOregon